Band Description: A revolving trio of market traders who perform from a tethered barge. Their aesthetic is utilitarian elegance—weathered hands, gold-toothed smiles, and a stoic, rhythmic commitment to the "long-play" of the morning tide. They play with a haunting, surgical precision, often using custom-built tactile triggers made from dried mangrove root.

